    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 9:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebyo kabyahoire abakuru bangoba bangambira bati, “Abaisiraeli n'abakuhani n'Abalevita tibalikweshorora mu banyamahanga aba Abakanaani, Abahiti, Abaperizi, Abayebusi, Abaamoni, Abamoabu, Abamisiri, n'Abaamori; mara nibachwa emiziro yaitu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.9.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.9.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 9:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nibashwera bahara babo kandi nibashwelereramu na batabani babo. Aha rw'ekyo eihanga litakatifu lyetabangijainyie n'abanyamahanga. Omu ntambara egi abakuru n'abami nibo rwituza.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.9.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.9.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 9:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kanahuliire ekyo ntagura emyendo yange n'ebebo yange. Nkunyura eishoke n'ebileju, nshuntama nchunchubaire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.9.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.9.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 9:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho bona abatinire ebyo Ruhanga wa Isiraeli yagambire aha rw'entambara y'abarugire omu buzahe, bambumbilira; inye aho nshuntamire nchunchubaire kuhika orwo twagiire kutamba ekitambo kya bwaigoro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.9.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.9.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 9:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aha izoba ly'ekitambo kya bwaigoro nyimuka nduga mbali nabaire nsiibire, ebijwaro byange n'ebebo yange bitagwire, mbutama ahansi ntekire amajwi, nyanjulira Omukama Ruhanga wange engaro ningamba nti, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.9.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.9.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 9:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Waitu Ruhanga wange, ninshonara kukuleba iwe Ruhanga wange, kuba entambara zaitu zatushaga aha mutwe, twashobya twashagulirana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.9.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.9.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 9:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwema omu makiro ga baisheichwe kugoba kir'eki tukafakara muno. Hamoi n'abakama baitu tukagwa omu mikono y'abakama abanyamahanga, batwisa embanda, batunyaga, batutwara endore na mwaha tukyashonaire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.9.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.9.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 9:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kyonkai mbwenu omu kanya kagufi Mukama Ruhanga waitu otusingiire kutatumaraho, watuha obuturo omu nsi ntakatifu egi, watukyanura aha maisho, watwihya n'omu bwiru mbali tubaire tuli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.9.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.9.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 9:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tubaire tuli bairu kyonkai totunagiraine mu bwiru bwaitu obwo. Otugilire ekisha, wahindura abakama ba Perisia batwihya omu bwiru kwija kwombeka Rwensinga ya Ruhanga waitu, kugishubamu mbali yakambukire n'okutulinda omuli Yuda na Yerusalemu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.9.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.9.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 9:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.9.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.9.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 9:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Mbwenu, waitu Ruhanga waitu, tukigambeki ahali eki? Tunagiraine emihango yawe ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.9.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.9.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 9:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "eyo wahangiire omu kanwa k'abairu bawe oti, ‘Ensi eyo mulikutahamu kulya, abanyansi bayo bakahagara bagihagaza yona buli rubaju, bagijwize ebinyamunuge. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.9.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.9.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 9:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aha rw'ekyo batabani babo mutabasiigira bahara banyu, anga batabani banyu kubashwelereramu bahara babo. Kandi mutabegongosheleza, kuba nirwo mugira emirembe anga egoshoko. Aho nirwo muligira amani mukalya akashaju kayo mukagisikisa abana banyu ebiro byona.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.9.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.9.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 9:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "N'orwo tubaire twaboine ekibonabonyio nituzira amafu gaitu n'entambara zaitu, tuboine okwo nangu n'ekibonabonyio ekyo kitasaine ntambara zaitu ezo, washuba watuhungya na mwaha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.9.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.9.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 9:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mbwenu tushube tuchwe emihango yawe tusiigirane n'abanyamahanga abakora ebya katozi ebi? Isi totunigaliire okatumaraho tukaburwa ow'okusigaraho anga ow'okuhunga? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.9.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.9.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 9:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waitu Mukama Ruhanga wa Isiraeli, iwe oba w'amazima, kyonkai okatukiza, leba abahungire n'ichwe aha. Tuli omu maisho gawe nitukutonganaho, kyonkai twaba tutasaine kwemelera omu mabona gawe orwo tuli babi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.9.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.9.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
